WEBVTT

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:11.360
Found you.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.510
Koushiro.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.500
Aki, here's some advice...

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.570
Come with me.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.780
If the Kuga catch you,

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.710
you'll spend the rest of your life behind bars.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.980
The Hyuga leader says they'd welcome you.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.210
I can't see any reason for you to refuse.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.030
I don't care about the Hyuga.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.750
How many hundreds of years

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.600
have you all sat in that tiny village, vying over power?

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.400
You have the power of the gods.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.290
Don't you think it's stupid?

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:51.600
A kakashi has about as much power 
as a lone tank.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.490
It's not like you can take over the world with it.

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:57.000
But you believe it has the power of a god?

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:01.870
You shouldn't take the crap our 
idiot ancestors told us that seriously...

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:09.630
The never missing Uwazutsu.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:12.800
But never missing means you can predict

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.070
where it will land.

00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:19.010
Once you get the timing down, it's easy to dodge.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:23.020
Then it's time for Kuramitsuha?

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:57.610
Really? Easy, huh?

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:01.410
Now what? Aim at another point?

00:03:14.490 --> 00:03:16.960
I never thought moving around 
the city would be so hard.

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:21.070
It isn't so different from the 
mountain behind our village.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:26.620
<i>Koushiro's kakashi can instantaneously 
appear and attack.</i>

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:33.890
That won't work.

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:35.770
Nowhere for you to hide.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.490
I missed again?

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:59.340
I'm not used to this environment.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.850
<i>He shouldn't be able to see me.</i>

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.070
<i>So how's he doing this?</i>

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.890
It stinks!

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.280
This is the first time he messed up.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.470
Smell?

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:29.870
He must have fallen somewhere really smelly.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.920
Whatever...

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.380
Uwazutsu's scent marking won't disappear that easily.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.760
<i>Though I have no proof...</i>

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:39.860
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.590
What is this? It stinks!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:49.970
Did I get him?

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.460
<i>Someone interfered?</i>

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:05.360
<i>Who?</i>

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.930
It looks different, but it's the same thing...

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:12.490
I know it!

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:33.070
You okay?

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:37.270
So that was you? No one asked for you help.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:40.550
Without my help, you would have died.

00:05:40.550 --> 00:05:42.520
No way.

00:05:43.350 --> 00:05:44.030
Where is he?

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:47.530
Lying on the ground, somewhere over there.

00:05:48.220 --> 00:05:49.270
Huh?

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.160
Looks like he ran.

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:54.850
Jeez...

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:56.650
You really are a kid.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.920
You have to finish what you start.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.920
<b>Episode 4</b>

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.920
<b>Heruma</b>

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.880
We should have expected this...

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.260
The mud mixed with the salt water,

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:12.720
and it smells terrible.

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.800
Utao-chan, use this for the hard-to-reach spots.

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:16.770
Okay!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.320
All right...

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.460
<i>That presence...</i>

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.280
<i>That was a Seki.</i>

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:45.460
<i>But I've never felt anything like it in the village.</i>

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.850
<i>And that feeling...</i>

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:51.800
Um... Utao-chan?

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:52.640
Hmm?

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.290
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:06:57.430 --> 00:06:58.830
Ahh! Just put it down!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:00.800
Oh no!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:01.260
Sorry!

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:01.880
Aahh!

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:02.690
Sorry!

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.770
U-Um, I'm sorry...

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:10.550
Oh, it's fine.

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.570
We're taking one anyway...

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.410
Time to take a bath!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.040
I'm back.

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:24.400
Both here, huh?

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.590
Utao, you in the bath?

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.320
Kyohei!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:33.230
Utao-chan, did you say something?

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:34.600
You're back?

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:35.410
Yeah.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.390
See you in a bit.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:39.110
Hey, Kyohei...

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:40.560
Yes?

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:44.940
I think I encountered a Seki today...

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.270
Koushiro?

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.240
No.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.960
Why did you bring up Koushiro?

00:07:53.350 --> 00:07:54.870
He's after Aki.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.200
Aki ran away again.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:07:58.950
Aki did?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:00.790
Utao?

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:03.270
What's wrong...

00:08:17.420 --> 00:08:19.530
That Seki you saw...

00:08:20.410 --> 00:08:22.730
If it wasn't Koushiro,

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:26.610
that means the Hyuga sent multiple Seki.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.420
Or...

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.890
Or?

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:34.110
<i>Someone from the Kuga?</i>

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:38.950
Anyway, keep an eye on Hibino-san.

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:42.760
Aki saw her with us.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:44.330
He threatened me.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:48.270
Shouldn't you watch her yourself?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.920
I'd love to, but...

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:55.720
But given what happened,

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.020
I'd rather not be around her

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:00.140
until this settles down.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:04.270
Um... Didn't you see me, too?

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:06.740
Are you an idiot?

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:08.870
You're my relative, and you're a kid.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:09.800
That's just creepy.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:23.120
I'm sorry about everything today.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.780
A lot of stuff was bothering me,

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:29.380
and I wanted to talk to Kyohei right away.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.520
So...

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.590
It isn't really your fault, Utao-chan.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:36.950
It feels like

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.460
an assault is only a matter of time, and it scares me.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:40.410
An assault?

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:44.920
Utao-chan...

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:47.880
This is ridiculously cliché but,

00:09:47.880 --> 00:09:49.740
this is salt.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:57.720
Kuuko!

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.200
Heading home?

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:07.030
Kuga-kun?

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:10.290
Hibino-san!

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.520
Got a second?

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.630
Yes...

00:10:13.010 --> 00:10:14.140
Thank you.

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.910
Sure, just leave it there.

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:20.510
Hey, are they really dating?

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:23.380
I never expected it would actually work out for him.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:24.990
But why?

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:26.730
He's so boring.

00:10:27.650 --> 00:10:31.050
I'm really sorry about yesterday...

00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:31.900
Hey...

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.060
Yes?

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:36.030
I just ran into Kuuko.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.780
Oh, Karahari-san?

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.290
She was saying some weird stuff...

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.610
That she'd found someone

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:45.410
connected to the scarecrow monster.

00:10:49.430 --> 00:10:51.290
I'm back.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:55.550
I wanted to interrogate you as soon as possible,

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.890
but the deadline for the apologies I had to write,

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:01.300
to keep from getting expelled, was today.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.010
Now...

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.020
Let's get started.

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:19.610
Someone in this city, 
with some connection to the kakashi...

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.050
There are lots of people like me,

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:25.540
who came from the village and know about them.

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:29.370
But if she explicitly said "scarecrow monster"...

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:32.750
...I think it's a safe bet she meant a Seki.

00:11:33.260 --> 00:11:35.890
I hope she hasn't gotten herself into any trouble.

00:11:35.890 --> 00:11:38.480
That's why I wanted to go see.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.880
We should be prepared.

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:43.710
I'll call Utao.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.410
You're a real pervert.

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.970
You kidnapped me and then stripped me.

00:11:53.970 --> 00:11:55.710
What?

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:59.110
I couldn't leave stuff that smelly in my room.

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.240
This place isn't that different from a dump.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.010
Shut up!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.030
Let's get to the point.

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:10.540
Those scarecrow monsters with you guys...

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.880
Tell me about them.

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:14.420
What are they?

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.790
Aliens?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.800
Some nation's secret weapon?

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:19.900
Scarecrows?

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.300
Secret weapon?

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.520
You're going to play dumb?

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:25.050
Fine.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:29.830
I'll make you tell me, no matter what.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:32.800
You'll soon be crying,

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:34.690
begging me to listen to you.

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:36.310
That's an air gun—

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.150
Don't worry.

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.850
I modified it, to increase the power.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:43.360
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:45.740
You'd better talk before you get hurt!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.290
What are you after?

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:58.750
I'm sick of this world!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.540
I tried to get into the paranormal,

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:03.120
but that didn't work!

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.270
They're all boring fakes,

00:13:04.270 --> 00:13:06.550
once you really start investigating.

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.430
But then I saw it!

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.400
What was it? I've never heard of anything like it.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.210
For the first time in ages, I was excited.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:19.110
And then I met you.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.610
Now, tell me.

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:22.900
What are they?

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.610
Why does something like that exist?

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:25.990
Answer me! Now!

00:13:31.350 --> 00:13:32.540
Jeez...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.730
You're a chatty bitch, aren't you?

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:41.550
Seventh, seventh, seventh...

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.120
She's late.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:50.060
Kyohei!

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.470
Hibino!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.520
Here I am!

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.630
You idiot...

00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:58.310
I told you to take the bus!

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.810
But I didn't know how to.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:02.730
Just hide that, already!

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.320
Well?

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:10.950
I've shown you, just like you asked.

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:12.830
What do you think?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:15.700
What is this?

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.080
Don't know.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:20.330
But whatever else it may be, it's power.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.620
And it's my power.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.010
That's all I ever needed to know.

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:29.010
Want to give me some of that power?

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:32.780
It isn't like bread that can be cut in two.

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:33.890
Give it up.

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:35.700
I see.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.010
Fine, then.

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:38.640
I'll figure out something.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.720
What's wrong with you?

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:44.470
You had a map, right?

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:45.610
But...

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:50.570
Kuuko?

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:51.630
Hibino!

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:52.930
What's wrong?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.250
That hurt, damn it.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.060
Aki!

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.550
Aki...

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.130
Fancy running into you here, Kyohei.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.550
Nice to meet you, miss.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.930
I'm Aki, an old friend of his.

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:20.190
<i>This guy's the murderer.</i>

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.940
Oh, I get it.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.820
Now I understand why you're so obsessed.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:28.250
She looks a lot like

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:29.900
sensei.

00:15:55.670 --> 00:15:57.220
You're still laughing?

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:58.350
Miss!

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.350
You see that?

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.480
This is his true nature.

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:06.730
He's just like me...

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.490
Shut up.

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:10.740
Shut up!

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.010
Stop pretending, already.

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:19.950
Bye.

00:16:26.860 --> 00:16:28.420
Hey...

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.820
What's going on out here?

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:32.710
Hey... what is it?

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:35.890
Let's go, Utao!

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.720
You follow them, too!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:39.870
Didn't someone just fall?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.100
But, Kuuko!

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:41.480
Forget about me.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.500
Hey, they fell, right?

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.700
Don't let him get away.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.230
He's my lead!

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:48.930
Should I call someone? An ambulance? the police?

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.840
Man, I screwed up.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:50.350
I should have upped the taser's voltage...

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:51.820
Hey, don't you need to call someone?

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:52.890
Shut up!

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.110
Don't touch me, you perverted NEET.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:56.890
Damn it.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:58.000
Let's split up...

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.070
You go that way!

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:03.600
Okay... This might work, after all.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.120
Seems they know him.

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:08.770
If I have to, I can use Hibino.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.570
I forgot my bra.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:13.630
Whatever.

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.550
It's hard to imagine

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:21.170
that someone who ran away

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:22.590
would return to it.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:27.310
Which means that this should be a good hideout.

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:33.070
Damn... I don't know if I'm lucky or in trouble.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:37.260
<i>Where is he?</i>

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:40.580
<i>Where did he go?</i>

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:42.580
<i>Where did he go?!</i>

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.660
<i>Aki!</i>

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.710
<i>She looks a lot like sensei.</i>

00:17:50.410 --> 00:17:51.710
<i>Kyohei-kun?</i>

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:59.090
<i>Make sure to stay friends with Aki-kun forever.</i>

00:18:02.480 --> 00:18:04.850
<i>Make sure to stay friends with...</i>

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:08.600
I can't... I can't, Sensei.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:12.180
Kuga-kun?

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:13.250
Where are you?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:14.150
Damn it!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.740
Damn it! Damn it!

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:17.990
Screw that bastard!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.780
I'll never forgive him! Not ever!

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:24.870
He... He...

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:27.580
How dare he say that to me—

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.670
You'll break your hand.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.790
He... I...

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:38.550
I understand.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:40.990
I understand, okay?

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:46.290
Where did he go?

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:52.520
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:55.650
That was dangerous, Utao.

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:58.260
You have to be careful.

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:06.910
Hey, Utao.

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:11.290
The same face as mine...

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:15.070
I'm happy I could surprise you.

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:18.300
But I guess it means you didn't hear, after all.

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:22.530
They were hiding me.

00:19:22.530 --> 00:19:23.550
All of them.

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:25.970
All of them?

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.350
All of the Kuga.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.560
Who are you?

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:31.570
I'm you.

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:32.980
You're me.

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:35.520
We're each one half, sharing the same blood.

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:39.810
A pair, just like a kakashi and a Seki.

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.510
I'm your Seki.

00:19:42.460 --> 00:19:43.910
What are you doing?

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:46.790
You want to fight, in the middle of a city?

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:49.160
Isn't that forbidden?

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.360
Letting people see it...

00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:54.420
Right?

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:55.710
Shut up!

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.330
That was stupid, Utao.

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.590
You didn't know what your opponent has,

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:13.270
but you rushed in, anyway.

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.730
What are you doing?

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:19.690
Relax. Relax.

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:21.600
Take a breath.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:22.780
Like this...

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.260
I see.

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:29.390
So much is happening,

00:20:29.390 --> 00:20:32.000
your mind just went blank.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:34.460
That's cute, Utao.

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:49.220
That means you're worth teasing.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.200
That should do it...

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.680
I'm sorry to take your handkerchief.

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:58.730
It's scary.

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:03.200
Seeing someone get so angry, all of a sudden.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:05.300
Can you explain...

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:06.240
I'm sorry!

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.290
I'm sorry...

00:21:10.530 --> 00:21:11.630
I see.

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:15.590
Hey, where's Utao-chan?

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:17.320
Wasn't she with you?

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:24.950
Kukuri?

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:26.930
This sound...

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:30.850
Takemikazuchi?

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:35.310
Utao-chan!

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:36.160
No, it's not!

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:42.590
<i>Who is that?</i>

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.490
Kyohei!

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:48.240
Utao-chan?

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:50.950
Who are you?

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:53.950
That's not very nice of you to say,

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.210
Brother.

00:21:56.570 --> 00:21:58.560
W... What?

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:37.260
Kamisama Dolls Corner! Wow!

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:46.820
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls</b>

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:46.820
<b>Corner</b>

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:38.700
Today we'll talk about the kakashi!

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:39.490
Here we go!

00:23:39.490 --> 00:23:40.960
The sharp one is Kuramitsuha.

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>It's sharp.</b>

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>I don't 
like it.</b>

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:42.590
It's really strong and pointy. I don't like it.

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:42.690
<b>It looks 
strong.</b>

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:42.690
<b>I don't 
like it.</b>

00:23:42.590 --> 00:23:43.980
The stick-like one is Uwazutsu.

00:23:43.340 --> 00:23:44.020
<b>A stick!?</b>

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:45.650
It has a good sense of smell and teleports.

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:44.520
<b>It's 
gone.</b>

00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:45.650
<b>It 
reappeared.</b>

00:23:45.650 --> 00:23:46.530
That's all for today!

00:23:45.670 --> 00:23:46.820
<b>To Be 
Continued</b>

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:47.410
Next time: To Home.

00:23:46.840 --> 00:23:49.930
<b>Next Episode: 
To Home...</b>

00:23:47.410 --> 00:23:49.240
If you don't watch it, we'll come to your house.

